<title>RUSSIA: Rouble eases to 3,667.99 per mark in Moscow.</title>
<headline>Rouble eases to 3,667.99 per mark in Moscow.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The rouble eased to 3,667.99 to the German mark on the Moscow Interbank Currency Exchange from 3,655.00 on Tuesday.</p>
<p>				    Nov 20		  Nov 19</p>
<p> Mark rate			3,667.99		3,655.00</p>
<p>-- Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
